      <div class="getting-started">
        <h3>Here are a few ideas on how to get started with Quesby:</h3>
        <ul class="getting-started-list">
            <li>Edit this page in <code>src/index.njk</code></li>
            <li>Customize your site settings in <code>src/_data/site.json</code></li>
            <li>Add your content in <code>src/content/posts/</code> or use the CMS at <code>/admin/</code></li>
            <li>Switch themes in <code>src/themes/</code> (quesby-core or quesby-brand-website)</li>
            <li>Configure your CMS in <code>src/admin/config.yml</code></li>
            <li>Customize the blog post layout in <code>src/_includes/layouts/single-post.njk</code></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
